{
    "word": "churchwarden",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "509ea51c-50a4-3564-9d82-0047d757b892",
                "word": "churchwarden",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6f8e8005-1af0-451d-be4f-5b87ce45acd7",
                        "entry_id": "509ea51c-50a4-3564-9d82-0047d757b892",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "churchwardens"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e50175bd-c10d-3871-9cd2-15caeaa028b0",
                        "entry_id": "509ea51c-50a4-3564-9d82-0047d757b892",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A lay officer of the Church of England who handles the secular affairs of the parish."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d948d424-a6a1-4f8f-a88f-e99d0b5f5069",
                                "sense_id": "e50175bd-c10d-3871-9cd2-15caeaa028b0",
                                "text": "At first, not knowing any better, I used sometimes to copy a nude on the pavement. The first I did was outside St Martin's-in-the-Fields church. A fellow in black—I suppose he was a churchwarden or something—came out in a tearing rage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4a7f699-d2c2-4873-803d-2f986c662e78",
                                "sense_id": "e50175bd-c10d-3871-9cd2-15caeaa028b0",
                                "text": "One important office that has survived for over 800 years is that of the churchwarden, established in the middle of the 12th century."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ff257fcb-1425-3489-9fbe-3befe78bbb82",
                        "entry_id": "509ea51c-50a4-3564-9d82-0047d757b892",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A similar functionary of the Episcopal church."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d71d9d2-ab7a-37e7-b3fe-dd81ec53e277",
                        "entry_id": "509ea51c-50a4-3564-9d82-0047d757b892",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ellipsis of churchwarden pipe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "British",
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "ellipsis",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b25c3e51-4531-4471-b60b-313bb69b071f",
                                "sense_id": "3d71d9d2-ab7a-37e7-b3fe-dd81ec53e277",
                                "text": "In one part of Cockaigne an amalgamation of these two last has lately taken place; and the pleasure experienced by the parishioners of Walbrook is unbounded when smoking an alderman and churchwarden."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63dc5761-e174-40e7-9553-e211f7996050",
                                "sense_id": "3d71d9d2-ab7a-37e7-b3fe-dd81ec53e277",
                                "text": "[T]here was a small wooden table placed in front of the smouldering fire, with decanters, a jar of tobacco, and two long churchwardens. The second churchwarden was supposed to be placed there for the service of Mr. Fred; but as a matter of fact that young gentleman did not find much gaiety in sitting and listening to grumblings over his own conduct and gloomy prophecies as to the future of the agricultural interests of the country; so that the old man generally sat there alone, nor had he ever been known to ask any one to keep him company."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7917818b-b80a-44e6-aacc-1c55880435bb",
                                "sense_id": "3d71d9d2-ab7a-37e7-b3fe-dd81ec53e277",
                                "text": "He greeted William with cordiality. \"Ah, Boot, how are you? Don't think I've had the pleasure before. Know your work well of course. Sit down. Have a cigarette or\"—had he made a floater?—\"or do you prefer your churchwarden?\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30c604e3-35fd-4393-8d55-6f8a2fff7f24",
                        "source_entry_id": "509ea51c-50a4-3564-9d82-0047d757b892",
                        "source_sense_description": "lay officer who handles secular affairs of the parish",
                        "target_lang_word": "kerkmeester",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kerkmeester",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a755388e-ffd8-3108-999c-0c96d568fcfd",
                                        "entry_id": "e9bbc7a6-0163-3665-8815-f32f22d5c2d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "beheerder van een kerkgebouw"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "beroep"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03826dfb-4bb9-4831-8d42-f4cb74d3fd24",
                                                "sense_id": "a755388e-ffd8-3108-999c-0c96d568fcfd",
                                                "text": "' Of schoon deze invitatie vergezeld ging van een revérence die het hart van een kerkmeester wellicht zou hebben vertederd, liet de bode er zich echter geenszins door vermurwen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39dac5c3-560a-405f-9857-734587ef7e5a",
                                                "sense_id": "a755388e-ffd8-3108-999c-0c96d568fcfd",
                                                "text": "Hij was in gezelschap van zijn assistent, die pigmenten stond te mengen, een kerkmeester die voor een portret poseerde en zijn schoonmoeder, die elders in huis het huishouden deed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "529dc5e8-a736-38e4-9800-f0edcab4e946",
                                        "entry_id": "e9bbc7a6-0163-3665-8815-f32f22d5c2d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "lid van het kerkbestuur"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "beroep"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7abdafa5-8e69-4f73-a77f-6751519dabb8",
                        "source_entry_id": "509ea51c-50a4-3564-9d82-0047d757b892",
                        "source_sense_description": "lay officer who handles secular affairs of the parish",
                        "target_lang_word": "kerkvoogd",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kerkvoogd",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "381145f9-b131-30b2-b588-d556d6469733",
                                        "entry_id": "3e2d3da2-a261-3e59-84ca-7ef730c8ae1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "beheerder van een kerkgebouw"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b110ea86-08c3-4a8e-a680-5dfa21fafb44",
                                                "sense_id": "381145f9-b131-30b2-b588-d556d6469733",
                                                "text": "Jan Kamerling (74) is zo'n lokale held. Lid in de Orde van Oranja-Nassau mag hij zich nu noemen. Hij is jaren diaken, kerkvoogd en vrijwilliger bij de Hervormde Gemeente Wierden. Tevens zet Kamerling zich in voor de Stichting Oost Europa Enter/Rijssen/Wierden. De Wierdenaar houdt de financiële situatie scherp in de gaten als penningmeester en hij voert de contacten met Hongarije, Roemenië en Oekraïne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73e190f5-91ba-4a81-9cdb-f49242a4e484",
                                                "sense_id": "381145f9-b131-30b2-b588-d556d6469733",
                                                "text": "64 jaar lid van het Hervormd Zangkoor. Bekleedde meerdere bestuursfuncties. Van 1974 tot 1979 ambtsdrager en kerkvoogd. Sinds1985 lid van het ouderenkoor Levensvreugd. Collectant voor de Nierstichting sinds 1971."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "660af3fc-09eb-48c6-91b5-c7b8b7ba879f",
                                                "sense_id": "381145f9-b131-30b2-b588-d556d6469733",
                                                "text": "De Rijssense stadsorganist Dick Sanderman opteerde voor een pijporgel, maar kan zich de andere keuze wel voorstellen. \" Maar het blijft natuurlijk een substituut met luidsprekergeluid...\" Kerkvoogd Wim Geerdink is zeer tevreden over het eindresultaat: \"We hebben de Rolls Royce onder de elektronische orgels.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2736fd52-067c-45b8-aa9d-59e5b37f2c52",
                                                "sense_id": "381145f9-b131-30b2-b588-d556d6469733",
                                                "text": "De gemeente Aalten heeft drie genomineerden aangewezen voor de monumentenprijs. Het gaat om kerkvoogd Bertus Post van de Helenakerk, villa Vinkenburg in Bredevoort en boerderij Ovink Ni-jhuus in Dinxperlo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff4d1d56-2709-39f7-ae29-403181dd01c2",
                                        "entry_id": "3e2d3da2-a261-3e59-84ca-7ef730c8ae1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "geestelijk die de leider is van een kerkgenootschap"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "727d8de7-f800-4449-8eee-c95c02a909cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "509ea51c-50a4-3564-9d82-0047d757b892",
